  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.15 Baseline",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.15 “Baseline” means the NOx emission inventory approved by the ozone transport commission (OTC) as the official 1990 baseline emissions of May 1 through September 30 for purposes of the NOx budget program.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
